        "TileImage": "$($repository 5d66981e-2ced-499c-9330-3e0bfd4688b3).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47 \rBefore you Eliminate Don Yates and Tamara Vidal I need you to Eliminate 4 fromer ICA assassins now working for Providence. They will undoubtedly complicate the mission. If possible please kill Ritchie Vidal with a bag of gun powder. \rI will leave you prepare good luck \rP.S. I have left you a wet suit in the guard room use it to escape in the drain pipe \rHugs and Tickles- Diana",
